{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17895","headline":"句 · 令狐楚","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何日居三署，终年尾百僚。\n移石几回敲废印，开箱何处送新图。\n唯应四仲祭，使者暂悲嗟。\n偶逢蒲家郎，乃是葛仙客。\n行常乘青竹，饥即煮白石。\n腰间嫌大组，心内保尺宅。\n我愿从之游，深卜链上液。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}